/**
 * Landing.tsx
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------
 * Drop-in React/TSX version of the "AI Content Commander" landing page.
 * 100% faithful port of index.html — same pixel-art hero, same layout,
 * same copy, same CSS animations. Nothing was redesigned.
 *
 * WHERE TO PUT IT
 *   - Next.js (App Router):  app/page.tsx  → `export { default } from "./Landing";`
 *     OR just paste this file's contents into app/page.tsx and drop the
 *     "use client" line if you want SSR (it's static — no client hooks needed
 *     unless the inline script runs; see LANDING_JS block below).
 *   - Vite / CRA / Remix:    src/pages/Landing.tsx
 *
 * DEPS
 *   Only React 18+. All hero assets are inlined as base64 (~400 KB file).
 *   Zero external CSS / icons / JS.
 *
 * LINKING TO THE DASHBOARD
 *   The "Launch Dashboard" / CTA links in the markup point to
 *   "dashboard.html". Replace with your route:
 *     - Next.js:  href="/dashboard"
 *     - React Router:  <Link to="/dashboard">
 *   Grep this file for `href="dashboard.html"` — there are a few.
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------
 */
